1
00:00:00,147 --> 00:00:01,687
(Penny:)What is the truth?

2
00:00:02,983 --> 00:00:06,023
(Sheldon:)My Mr. Spock doll came to me
in a dream and forced me to open it.

3
00:00:06,236 --> 00:00:10,286
(Sheldon:)And when the toy broke,
l switched it for yours.

4
00:00:10,490 --> 00:00:13,660
(Sheldon:)Later, he encouraged me to do
the right thing and I defied him.

5
00:00:13,869 --> 00:00:16,749
(Sheldon:)And then I was attacked by a Gorn.

6
00:00:20,542 --> 00:00:22,882
- Okay, that I believe.
- Mm.

7
00:00:23,086 --> 00:00:25,176
(Sheldon:)Leonard, Penny,
l want you both to know...

8
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:29,680
(Sheldon:)...that I regret my actions
towards the two of you. That's a lie.

9
00:00:30,886 --> 00:00:32,266
So is that one mine?

10
00:00:33,221 --> 00:00:35,351
(Raj:)- Yes.
- Well, hand it over so I can open it.

11
00:00:35,974 --> 00:00:37,394
(Penny:)Okay.

12
00:00:37,601 --> 00:00:40,271
(Sheldon:)And, Leonard,
even though I don't have one anymore...

13
00:00:40,478 --> 00:00:43,068
- ...l hope you have fun playing with it.
- That's a lie?

14
00:00:43,273 --> 00:00:44,733
- A big, fat whopper.
- Yeah.

15
00:00:46,568 --> 00:00:48,698
l hope it breaks.

16
00:00:54,451 --> 00:00:57,121
(Raj:)This is a treat. What brings you guys by?

17
00:00:57,662 --> 00:01:00,412
(Bernadette:)Raj, Howie told me what's going on
with you and Lakshmi.

